Dialogue: 30,0:00:06.74,0:00:07.74,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.07,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.54,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:40.90,0:00:46.53,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The goddess dances with the void, death, the Emperor, and eternity...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Is it true, Aldea?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:59.87,0:01:03.21,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Did you really see Zeros in Lemuria?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.58,0:01:06.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw it with my very own eyes.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.59,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Why didn't you report it to the brass?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:09.59,0:01:13.30,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Because I wanted you to get all the credit, Grabel.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:13.30,0:01:14.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're a fool...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:14.97,0:01:16.60,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:16.60,0:01:20.48,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The girl who was wielding Zeros called herself Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:25.15,0:01:28.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Then I suppose we'll have to do this ourselves.
