Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:04.58,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(404,473)\bord2.4\blur1.5\c&HFCFCFD&\fsp3\pos(537,1049.715)}Imperial Hero -Grabel-
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.66,0:03:03.04,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,Initiating sealing.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:03.29,0:03:06.04,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,The Entrance's Magitech signal strength is dropping.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,90, 70,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.67,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,50, 30...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.67,0:03:14.34,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The Magitech particles have dropped by 99.999 percent.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:14.34,0:03:15.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The sealing is complete.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.80,0:03:19.26,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So the data was the real deal?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.22,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,If we can seal the Entrances,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.06,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,then we can drastically alter the course of this war.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.39,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Now we have a way to make
Dialogue: 30,0:03:26.39,0:03:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the joint US-Japan operation to retake Okinawa a reality.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:29.31,0:03:34.40,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,But just who sent us this data?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:38.07,0:03:40.82,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I can't believe my first time is going to be with you.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.79,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,This should be fun!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:42.79,0:03:46.54,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I only brought you to the cafeteria because you told me you wanted to try it.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:46.54,0:03:47.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound weird.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:49.17,0:03:52.09,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,May we join you, Leader{-san}?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You guys are...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:55.55,0:03:58.47,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna forgive you!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:58.93,0:04:02.39,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm the Masters' leader, Scarlet Fairchild.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:02.39,0:04:03.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Nice to meetcha.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Gertrude Baird.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.56,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you-seless.{Nice to meet you, asshole.}
Dialogue: 30,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.31,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sharon Cunningham.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,S-So, what are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.36,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We joined the academy, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,For the joint operation, you know?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.11,0:04:23.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna, I heard you have a special power.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:23.87,0:04:27.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing special.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Now I'm even more interested.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:30.54,0:04:31.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,can you show me around Ataraxia?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.22,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Since we're both team leaders,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.93,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,we should get to know each other better.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.22,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.22,0:04:47.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna has a lunch appointment with me right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.60,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt us.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.69,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,G-Give me a break...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:58.03,0:04:58.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:00.65,0:05:02.20,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Okay, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.75,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,we can't let this valuable afternoon go to waste.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.21,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The only thing going to waste is all that fat in your boobs!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll just have to...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.72,0:05:22.01,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,...fight for him!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.55,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,It's on!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:30.89,0:05:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Champion!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.48,0:06:23.32,Dialogue Italics,Gu,0,0,0,,You guys are ballers!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.32,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.33,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,We're just getting started!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So, why are you having a swimsuit contest?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And am I even allowed to be here?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,{\ko3}{\ko50}{\2c&H0000FF&\2a&HFF&\c&H92F8FF&\3c&H353537&}Ki{\ko34}{\ko44}zu{\ko27}{\ko91}na!{\ko28}
Dialogue: 30,0:06:49.14,0:06:52.10,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,{\ko2}{\c&H7D5DEF&\3c&H6A6A6B&}{\ko47}{\2c&H0000FF&\2a&HFF&\3c&H353537&}He{\ko22}{\ko56}re {\ko60}I {\ko80}am! {\ko26}
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.81,0:06:57.35,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,They're wearing the same swimsuit?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you copying me?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.11,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}my{\i0} line!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.05,0:07:27.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,My breasts aren't as big, \Nbut my proportions are better, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:27.43,0:07:30.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why are you so obsessed with me?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:30.01,0:07:32.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm interested.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.47,0:07:33.89,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Interested in what?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Like, with the whole Heart Hybrid thing...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, what's it like?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.69,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Wanna try it with me?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:48.45,0:07:49.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.41,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,D-Don't move!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't talk!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.72,0:08:08.68,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Is this a Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.72,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.48,Dialogue,k,0,0,0,,Listen, Julicia,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.36,Dialogue,k,0,0,0,,what happened earlier was an accident...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.73,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.07,0:08:29.86,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It was silly of me to get worked up against a child.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.37,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.45,0:08:38.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey, Scarlet.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:45.30,0:08:46.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:46.71,0:08:50.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You and Julicia are actually friends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:50.01,0:08:50.93,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:50.93,0:08:53.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You were in perfect harmony when you were dancing.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And you have basically the same taste in swimsuits.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:55.81,0:08:56.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Scarlet...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:59.56,0:09:03.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You don't know what a horrible person Julicia is!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.23,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She used us as pawns to be sacrificed!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sacrificed?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It was our first time...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.45,0:09:18.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,fighting a Dragorie, a Category-A Magitech weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:19.91,0:09:21.83,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,W-We can't fight this thing!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.83,0:09:22.58,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Help—
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Julicia deliberately sent us on ahead
Dialogue: 30,0:09:31.97,0:09:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to fight the Dragorie.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:43.48,0:09:48.82,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And after she made us wear it down,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,she took all the glory for herself.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna forgive her!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}never{\i0} gonna forgive Julicia{, no matter what}!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:01.96,0:10:04.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't believe Julicia would do that.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,She's not that kind of person.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:07.71,0:10:08.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You were listening?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:18.47,0:10:19.22,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is what she said true?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.27,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If that's what she said, it probably is.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.65,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.58,Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.71,Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.75,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.75,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.88,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.92,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.92,0:10:55.01,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.51,Dialogue Top,Gi,0,0,0,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:59.51,0:11:03.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How dare she act like she's more\N important than the Royal Guard?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.14,0:11:06.81,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I think we should just let her do\N what she wants for now, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:06.81,0:11:08.31,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She's going to trip up eventually.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:08.31,0:11:10.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.91,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're getting too excited.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:17.91,0:11:19.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that? It's a celebration.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.95,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.50,0:11:27.42,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,On days like this, it starts to throb.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:34.09,0:11:36.84,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The lovely scar you gave me, that is.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:38.47,0:11:40.10,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The same goes for me.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.10,0:11:43.85,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A fragment of your spear is still inside me.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Did it hurt? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.98,0:11:46.85,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.86,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Grabel...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.36,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Stop it...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.61,0:11:59.53,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't wanna.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Aldea...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.77,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.02,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll get a battleship ready.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A long ranged one, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:31.69,0:12:33.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:35.36,0:12:36.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Then let's get back to it.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.53,0:12:43.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,N-Now's not the time—
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.03,0:12:45.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don' be like tha'.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.46,0:12:49.33,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's fine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.50,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.67,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're so mean, Grabel.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:58.63,0:12:59.67,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Captain,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:59.97,0:13:02.09,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sylvia made this in Home Ec!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.93,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Please share it with everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.31,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll make a good wife someday, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.31,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,A-A wife, you say?!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.19,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,N-No, it's too sudden!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.74,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Sylvia's still not old enough to marry,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.82,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,but if it was with you, Captain...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:20.82,0:13:21.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why?!  {Italics?}
Dialogue: 30,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why can't I find anything?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's me I'm looking up!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:41.59,0:13:47.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,"The goddess dances with the void, death, the Emperor, and eternity..."
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What am I?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There you are, Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:54.60,0:13:57.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.28,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm free to go wherever I want.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia made us some cookies.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't want any.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:07.08,0:14:07.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.66,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I said no, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I think you could use some.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why aren't you saying anything?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:25.93,0:14:26.93,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:28.43,0:14:31.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,There's something you want to ask me, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't want to ask about anything you don't want to talk about.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:37.40,0:14:41.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But, if you ever do want to talk about it, come straight to me.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:42.03,0:14:43.15,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.24,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.37,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:08.47,0:15:09.80,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,What's the situation?!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.85,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,How many enemies?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:11.85,0:15:12.81,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.60,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's one woman!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.02,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's a single, unarmed woman!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.57,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You, otherworlder!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.57,0:15:27.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Surrender quietly!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:27.66,0:15:30.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you came here all alone,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:30.74,0:15:32.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,but it was stupid of you.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:32.83,0:15:33.87,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm bored.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:33.87,0:15:35.00,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Can I shoot her?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.79,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Not yet, wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm General Grabel,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:39.92,0:15:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander of the Batlantis Empire's Lemuria Theater 6th Expeditionary Force.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:46.05,0:15:49.51,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I demand that you hand over\N the Zeros and its Magitech knight.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:49.51,0:15:50.68,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:50.93,0:15:54.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Otherwise I can't guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:54.43,0:15:57.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What? Are you fucking serious?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.98,0:16:00.56,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What are you going on about while in enemy territory?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.94,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Bite it, otherworlder.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Negotiations failed, then?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.33,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A-All units, engage!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.75,Dialogue Alternate Batlantis,Gi,0,0,0,,Zoros.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.81,0:16:39.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Gertrude? Sharon?!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:52.20,0:16:53.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,Lenn,That's...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:58.08,0:16:58.87,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Gertrude!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.37,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sharon!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:01.92,0:17:02.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Deploy!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.88,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wait! You can't just attack without a plan!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.09,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:24.44,0:17:26.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.98,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What ridiculous power!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:43.33,0:17:44.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:44.92,0:17:47.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's my fault this happened to you...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.42,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Forget about me.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:49.42,0:17:50.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa... Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:57.26,0:17:59.06,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Both of you stand back.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.31,0:18:01.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I can't let you handle this!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:01.64,0:18:02.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Piss off!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:02.98,0:18:04.85,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Are you going to fight with no ammo?!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:29.46,0:18:30.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.35,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Gunsword...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:39.47,0:18:40.77,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Raver.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.07,0:18:55.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You may be proud, Knight of Lemuria.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.45,0:18:59.24,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You forced me to use my Gunsword.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:02.00,0:19:04.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm going to hit you hard.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:04.75,0:19:05.75,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The Kuros, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Bullet!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:13.51,0:19:17.01,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No way... She was able to stop \Na full-power attack from the Kuros?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:18.93,0:19:19.76,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:34.15,0:19:35.53,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:36.78,0:19:37.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.47,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:00.47,0:20:04.81,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'll take out a peon like you with one hit.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:04.81,0:20:07.31,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:17.32,0:20:19.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I won't let you touch Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:20.66,0:20:22.08,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a man?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:37.34,0:20:38.84,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Wiped out...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.55,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Amaterasu has been wiped out!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:42.10,0:20:43.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:49.64,0:20:50.44,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.11,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Do you know who you are?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.40,0:20:59.15,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,If you want to know, come with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:03.16,0:21:04.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, male Magitech knight.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.14,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Get the recovery teams out there!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:22.47,0:21:25.14,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Hurry! No wasting time!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:23.14,0:21:25.14,Dialogue Overlap,Gi,0,0,0,,She let them go?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.77,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.31,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm almost out of magic, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:32.31,0:21:36.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Being on Lemuria really does exhaust more magic than I had anticipated.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:37.82,0:21:38.61,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:39.94,0:21:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, I will succeed.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.53,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What was that...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.42,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
